  "content": {
    "id": "p15-ch9-q6-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "Simplify:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\left(b^{\\frac23}\\right)^3\\times b^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$b^4$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\left(b^{\\frac23}\\right)^3\\times b^2&=b^{\\frac23\\times3}\\times b^2\\\\\\left(b^{\\frac23}\\right)^3\\times b^2&=b^{2+2}=b^4\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{a^4}{b^2}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{a^2}{|b|}$; if $b>0$, this is $\\dfrac{a^2}{b}$.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{\\frac{a^4}{b^2}}&=\\frac{\\sqrt{(a^2)^2}}{\\sqrt{b^2}}\\\\\\sqrt{\\frac{a^4}{b^2}}&=\\frac{a^2}{|b|}\\end{align*}$\n\nThe principal square root is nonnegative. For positive $b$, the result is $\\dfrac{a^2}{b}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{a^6}{b^3}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{a^2}{b}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{a^6}{b^3}}&=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{(a^2)^3}}{\\sqrt[3]{b^3}}\\\\\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{a^6}{b^3}}&=\\frac{a^2}{b}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{a^{\\frac13}b^{\\frac23}}{ab^2}\\div\\frac{ab^{\\frac43}}{a^2b^3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^{\\frac13}b^{\\frac13}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^{\\frac13}b^{\\frac23}}{ab^2}\\div\\frac{ab^{\\frac43}}{a^2b^3}&=\\frac{a^{\\frac13}b^{\\frac23}}{ab^2}\\times\\frac{a^2b^3}{ab^{\\frac43}}\\\\\\frac{a^{\\frac13}b^{\\frac23}}{ab^2}\\div\\frac{ab^{\\frac43}}{a^2b^3}&=a^{\\frac13+2-1-1}b^{\\frac23+3-2-\\frac43}\\\\\\frac{a^{\\frac13}b^{\\frac23}}{ab^2}\\div\\frac{ab^{\\frac43}}{a^2b^3}&=a^{\\frac13}b^{\\frac13}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a^5}{b^{10}}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{a}{b^2}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a^5}{b^{10}}}&=\\frac{\\sqrt[5]{a^5}}{\\sqrt[5]{(b^2)^5}}\\\\\\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a^5}{b^{10}}}&=\\frac{a}{b^2}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{27a^2}{b^3}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{3a^{\\frac23}}{b}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{27a^2}{b^3}}&=\\frac{3\\sqrt[3]{a^2}}{b}\\\\\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{27a^2}{b^3}}&=\\frac{3a^{\\frac23}}{b}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{32a^4b}{2ab^3}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{4a^{\\frac32}}{|b|}$; if $b>0$, this is $\\dfrac{4a^{\\frac32}}{b}$.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{\\frac{32a^4b}{2ab^3}}&=\\sqrt{\\frac{16a^3}{b^2}}\\\\\\sqrt{\\frac{32a^4b}{2ab^3}}&=\\frac{4a\\sqrt a}{|b|}\\\\\\sqrt{\\frac{32a^4b}{2ab^3}}&=\\frac{4a^{\\frac32}}{|b|}\\end{align*}$\n\nFor real values of the original expression, $a>0$ and $b\\ne0$. For positive $b$, the denominator is $b$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-ch9-q6-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$\\left(a^{\\frac14}\\right)^2\\times\\left(a^{\\frac14}\\right)^3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^{\\frac54}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\left(a^{\\frac14}\\right)^2\\times\\left(a^{\\frac14}\\right)^3&=a^{\\frac24}\\times a^{\\frac34}\\\\\\left(a^{\\frac14}\\right)^2\\times\\left(a^{\\frac14}\\right)^3&=a^{\\frac24+\\frac34}=a^{\\frac54}\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      }
    ]
  },
